{"overview":"چهار دوست خودخواه یک میخانه ایرلندی دوستانه را در فیلادلفیا اداره می‌کنند و سعی می‌کنند راه خود را در دنیای بزرگسالی کار و روابط پیدا کنند. متأسفانه، دیدگاه‌های نامعقول و قضاوت‌های بی‌اساس‌شان اغلب آن‌ها را به دردسر می‌کشاند و موقعیت‌های ناخوشایند بی‌شماری را ایجاد می‌کند که معمولاً به جای آنکه بهتر شوند بدتر می‌شوند.","tagline":"همدستان بیشتر برای پول شما.","overview_en":"Four egocentric friends run a neighborhood Irish pub in Philadelphia and try to find their way through the adult world of work and relationships. Unfortunately, their warped views and precarious judgments often lead them to trouble, creating a myriad of uncomfortable situations that usually only get worse before they get better.","tagline_en":"More Gang for your buck.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":68,"y":2007,"poster":"/ipLeaw8NiD4vmsNDDlUCbTDPiKY.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":2005,"poster":"/fwJAw3SxLUHMefk3xUEoJNj0sDR.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2006,"poster":"/dLFL9VgDs5eYkEhmesaqBXsiJfr.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":15,"y":2007,"poster":"/3iZ22xNjs4uM3MgGXSnlBewOlHH.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":13,"y":2008,"poster":"/el6bQvREj2UUD3k1JmGSg051yyH.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":12,"y":2009,"poster":"/5vSctyHifsbfMvefn043h0Oumqb.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":13,"y":2010,"poster":"/2QZB4HdRfi318smoInObzK5pfcG.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":13,"y":2011,"poster":"/hSXzCLwLNCW4ts4TjdMQhMzcmPf.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":10,"y":2012,"poster":"/geFSd4OPTi6JDTgtl8YDCJxDE2i.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":10,"y":2013,"poster":"/vEKFPIP8t43ee5RuZm8qg7al2Ue.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":10,"y":2015,"poster":"/clzI4ywJSsOYNNKx3Ig4DfAX2Zm.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":10,"y":2016,"poster":"/sJWEZbLdSTOgIqXBlg2LD4nYot5.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":10,"y":2017,"poster":"/yOnOaGdbDYfgOa4NE06vUdmapAX.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":10,"y":2018,"poster":"/AjyldoY2aGpe7jfBB3BxAqU5qai.jpg"},